  "prefLabel": "Fire 101.18 Mental health condition",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fire 101.18 “Mental health condition” means a condition defined in the Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders of the American Psychiatric Association, Fifth Edition, Text Revision (DSM-5-TR)(2022), available as provided in Appendix B, diagnosed by a psychologist or psychiatrist, based upon mental status examination or psychological testing.\n\nSource (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Fire 100) #12225-A, eff 6-28-17; ss by #14171, eff 1-10-25",
